# What not to upload to Cloud Build.
#
# node_modules alone is hundreds of megabytes and is rebuilt from the lockfile
# on the other side anyway; .next is the local build, which the remote one
# replaces. Uploading either wastes minutes per deploy and can trip the source
# size limit.
node_modules/
.next/
.env.local
.env
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store

# Diagnostics and one-off probes. They talk to the live API and have no business
# in a production image.
scripts/
